{
  "name": "rust-gpu-tools",
  "description": "A cross-platform Rust abstraction library designed to provide a unified interface for executing GPU kernels on both CUDA and OpenCL backends. It streamlines GPGPU development by abstracting device discovery, memory buffer management, and kernel dispatch into a single host-side API. The library employs a synchronous execution model for enhanced safety and supports a broad range of hardware including NVIDIA, AMD, Intel, and Apple Silicon via conditional compilation of specialized runtimes.",
